{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Check the monotonic deadline, not only timer delivery**\n\nA `Timer` callback may run late. If a response completes after `expires_at` but before the callback acquires the GIL, `timer.cancel()` prevents the event from being set and this check returns the late response as success. Derive expiry from `time.monotonic()` at response completion and in the connect guards; use the event only to interrupt the socket. Add a delayed-timer regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7vqrg3","finding_digest":"9e71a3f1dfb81f9497cc7360c2624f88ff2f6a46d4e91fe97e53821dd12c17e4","finding_id":"arf_v1_tzy2h4o7xapzjf6monqmeysprd","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::_deadline::monotonic-expiry-detection","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::_deadline::monotonic-expiry-detection","line":216,"observation_digest":"106d7d31277644e632be065654850efce40569a334150ab55d1c8368356483d4","observation_id":"aro_v1_cbwx2mjhozcommv6azlfjbio7t","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/exporters/_common.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-15T22:59:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_y4ciaxbdlrpkq2gi7z7ncoxmd3","reviewed_base_sha":"15fa221c0f6010d040f6f1418ff70e3e2e2e298f","reviewed_head_sha":"37e5029b35d0568b5fc10a55ff1862baea2d4de8","reviewer":"codex","start_line":216,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":729},"record_id":"art_v1_b5ow2k7ycfq5cbnjkvfdj5k7kw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-15T22:59:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
